{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"bush_bog_pear","model_identifier":"bush_bog_pear","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# bush_bog_pear\n\nBog pear bush (Patch 5): a low, sprawling dark-leaved bog plant with purplish undersides on a mossy pad, holding one pumpkin-sized dark purple pear in the middle. Grows only in bogs with a bog guardian.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -23..20, y 0..21, z -21..20 units. Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 256 x 128, 1 px per unit, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: 80 (full 45, picked 35).\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `full` (visible by default)\n- `picked`: the plant without its pear (shown until the pear regrows)"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"moss_bog_pad#34402c","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-18,0,-16],"to":[18,1.5,16],"autouv":0,"color":6,"origin":[0,0.75,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[204,74,240,76],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[108,78,140,80],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,78,36,80],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[140,78,172,80],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,36,32],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[36,0,72,32],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"b18ae316-fcac-8266-e4ec-4b834eb3ff3d"},{"name":"moss_bog_pad#2e3a28","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-23,0.44,-14.15],"to":[17,1.74,6.15],"autouv":0,"color":5,"origin":[-3,1.09,-4],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[120,84,160,85],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[40,86,60,87],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[160,84,200,85],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[60,86,80,87],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[144,0,184,20],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[184,0,224,20],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"606a0f95-3c09-882