rue,"saved":true,"uuid":"f06dd478-7c5c-24f8-09f5-3e924a1aad4a","source":"data:image/png;base64,","relative_path":""}],"description":"# bush_bog_pear\n\nBog pear bush (Patch 5): a low, sprawling dark-leaved bog plant with purplish undersides on a mossy pad, holding one pumpkin-sized dark purple pear in the middle. Grows only in bogs with a bog guardian.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -23..20, y 0..21, z -21..20 units. Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 256 x 128, 1 px per unit, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: 80 (full 45, picked 35).\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `full` (visible by default)\n- `picked`: the plant without its pear (shown until the pear regrows)"}